{"agent_id":"pp3g-N94x-delta-re-review-of-the-finalized-workflow-topology","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-08T00:00:13.777879877Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"48b953c8-85fa-42ed-886a-b1786271d270","comment_uuid":"6d21a257-dfd7-4648-9d52-a8274a0f7a05","author":"pp3g-N94x-delta-re-review-of-the-finalized-workflow-topology","content":"Plan: Independent re-derivation of the 5 deltas in the FINALIZED synthesis on #241 (the 23:43 'decision' comment). For each delta, assess: (1) does the design do what it claims? (2) are the gaps/risks named? (3) is anything load-bearing missing? Verdict form: per-delta AGREE/DISAGREE-with-rationale + an overall verdict. Specifically scrutinize: the trigger set for AUDITOR (a); storage/cadence/evidence-link concreteness for position store (b); the orchestrator's SPOF and supervision-of-orchestrator gap (c); provenance of the external correctness anchor + non-delivery taxonomy (d); whether pre-consumption testability audit replaces or merely renames post-plan STOP A (e). Will NOT read other reviewer sub-issues (#250, #252) per brief. Output goes to #251 as --kind result.","created_at":"2026-08-08T00:00:13.772306941Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:AeFJHIyTRksanmzpycvM9aj2nyQdBUS3PjMr42DfwDw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+8GjH29kCkE0AeTFAKvtfnq+J8Wx4jZpWHpxoWgRhc4AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA15xBrQ1Gf0v61cPWTkdx/pPVIG3dy6FCVW/OKyFdTI2jtUL79ss4Ob71qNiV2tOxxcvhyGvjXB/AO6htKWIcAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:AeFJHIyTRksanmzpycvM9aj2nyQdBUS3PjMr42DfwDw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+8GjH29kCkE0AeTFAKvtfnq+J8Wx4jZpWHpxoWgRhc4AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHdWnEBaVOrdpHKLDmtc5anjtbTU+003tgikVfnh2cgc3aYld39IxrXp9Iyi+6JPZR9eNeVjNEIrs1BLJtRvNQo="}
